WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Alveolar air and blood meet across a thin barrier.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Oxygen moves from alveolar air into blood.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Carbon dioxide moves from blood into alveolar air.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Each gas follows its own partial-pressure gradient.
